        "Write positive 35-60/20-40/20-40-word blocks connecting candidate generation, model checking, real training augmentation and the retained classifier.",
        "Keep supplied held-out macro-F1 improvement and rare-fault recall decline; place unverified novelty and physical feasibility in proportional author notes."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
